{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"733827406078410763","content":"“And I’m ashamed that I am”","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:32:58.020000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746512200058798140","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"733827406078410763","content":"She is extremely pale","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:33:35.319000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746512356502274048","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827406078410763","content":"\"Its ok to feel fear. Fear is what tells you that you are in danger. Being in danger doesnt mean that you have done anything wrong.\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:33:57.755000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746512450605809786","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"733827406078410763","content":"Her lip quivers, “I’m supposed to be a leader. But i can’t lead them into battle if I’m terrified.”","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:34:38.484000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746512621435355226","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"733827406078410763","content":"She looks up at him, “Why did you choose me?”","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:35:03.781000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746512727538925658","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827406078410763","content":"\"I chose you to lead, because the best person to do so is one that is already humble and would never ask to lead. There are three ways to deal with danger. And each has their merit. Some times you freeze up. This is when its the right call to asses the situation. Sometimes its better to regroup and get stronger bring friends this is when it is wise to flee. And then there is the time to fight. Which is this wren?\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:37:56.835000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746513453379747972","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"733827406078410763","content":"She wipes her face","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:39:02.728000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746513729755021355","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"733827406078410763","content":"“It’s time to fight. We have done the preparation. We have done the assessing. We are strong.” She takes a breath and swallows hard","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:40:07.522000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746514001521016902","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"733827406078410763","content":"“But-“","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:40:13.572000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746514026896293921","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"733827406078410763","content":"She lets out a breath","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:40:20.010000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746514053899223072","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"733827406078410763","content":"“If I die,” she looks up at Daysong, eyes wide, “will I end up here?”","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:40:48.812000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746514174703697951","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827406078410763","content":"\"Is that what you want Wren? To be a knowledge spirit like me?\"","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:41:20.930000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746514309416484955","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"733827406078410763","content":"She pauses, “I-I’m not sure. I like reading, but it doesn’t call to me the way it does Selene.”","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:42:14.446000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746514533878726757","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"733827406078410763","content":"“But I’m not ready to die yet. I’m not ready to leave.”","created_at":"2020-08-21T23:42:25.428000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746514579940442152","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
